  "description": "Young Ed chases a rabbit that has escaped from the garden and enters the forest. Following the sound of footsteps, he comes face-to-face with a man devouring his own rabbit. Ed, who gives the strange man the name “Luca,” brings him back to the mansion as his butler. Several years later. With his coming-of-age ceremony approaching, Luca is still by Ed’s side. Ed believed he was taking care of the innocent, naive Luca, who knew nothing of the ways of the world. On the very night he was about to swear an eternal vow to him, promising they would stay together even after marriage, he catches Luca in bed with a stranger...\n\n *“It doesn’t matter what you are. But I’m the only one you’re allowed to do that with.”*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
